{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38053","headline":"暴雨 · 韩偓","name":"暴雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"电尾烧黑云，雨脚飞银线。\n急点溅池心，微烟昏水面。\n气凉氛祲消，暑退松篁健。\n丛蓼亚赬茸，擎荷飜绿扇。\n风期谁与同，逸趣余探徧。\n欲去更迟留，胸中久交战。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38053.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38053","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}